CORE
main.c
--validate-ssa-equation --program-only
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^Invariant check failed
--
The fields of a struct with a member of non-constant size (a GCC extension) are
SSA expressions whose original expression is a member expression. Renaming the
type of the field must also rename the type of the struct in the original
expression, else the member expression's type does not match the type of the
struct component.
